  "strings" : {
    "%@" : {

    },
    "`ErrorPresentationView` can lead the user to select an action multiple times. In this demo, you can hit the \"Open Settings\" button multiple times. Notice how a runtime warning %@ is triggered when you hit this button more than once. The warning suggests that we use the `allowMultipleActionExecutions` flag when creating the `FlowError`." : {

