    },
    "Some errors need specific recovering actions. `CLError(.denied)`, handled by `CLErrorHandler` has an extra \"Open Settings\" action." : {

    },
    "Some errors represent user cancellation, and must not be presented. This is the case of `CocoaError(.userCancelled)`, handled by `CocoaErrorHandler`." : {

    },
    "Some errors require a custom presentation. `FrobnicateError`, handled by `FrobnicateErrorHandler`, have a custom title and message, and no Retry button when the error is unrecoverable." : {

